  "description": "Change of Hart, 21 High St, Edgware",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The existing use of the site as a public house with ancillary accommodation is therefore lawful.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The lawful existing use of the site is a public house with ancillary accommodation on the first and second floors which would fall within the Sui Generis use class and would not result in a material change of use of the site as stated in Article 3.(3) and (6)(p) of the Town and Country Planning (Use Class) Order 1987 (as amended). Therefore, the existing use of the site would not constitute development as defined by section 55(2)(f) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
